msgid "<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Congratulations!</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>You may either claim your reward and end the game, or try again to earn an even larger payout. But remember, if you fail, all previous rewards are forfeit.<br><br>Current payout: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><num $n3></ui-edge-color></ui-color> MGP<br>Double down payout: <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><num $n4></ui-edge-color></ui-color> MGP<br><br>Double down opportunities remaining: <num $n2>"
