#. ja: 1日に3回以上「辞退」ボタンを押下、もしくは時間切れによる参加登録辞退を行うと、<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>カードバトルルームから強制的に退出されます。</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>また、一定時間コンテンツファインダーおよび<br>レイドファインダーでの参加申請ができなくなります。</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>よろしいですか？
#. de: Wird am selben Tag 3 Mal „Zurückziehen“ gewählt oder versäumt, rechtzeitig die Teilnahme zu bestätigen, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>wirst du aus dem Weltensalon entfernt und kannst die Inhaltssuche vor<shy>über<shy>gehend nicht mehr nutzen</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Trotzdem zurückziehen?
#. fr: Annuler votre par<shy>ti<shy>ci<shy>pa<shy>tion à un duel trois fois au cours d'une journée en cliquant sur “Se retirer” ou en laissant le compte à rebours arriver à son terme, <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>entraînera votre expulsion de l'arène Triple Triade</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Par ailleurs, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>vous ne pourrez plus utiliser les outils de mission et de raid pendant un certain temps</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.<br>Confirmer<nbsp>?
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
msgctxt "Addon:9538:0:0"
msgid "<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Withdrawing from a match three times a day, whether it be via the withdraw button or allowing the timer to run out, will result in dismissal from the Battlehall as well as a penalty temporarily restricting use of both Duty and Raid Finders.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Proceed?"
msgstr "<ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Если вы трижды за день откажетесь от матча — кнопкой или дождавшись конца таймера, — вас исключат из Зала карточных баталий, а поиск активностей и рейдов на время станет недоступен.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>Продолжить?"

