#. ja: 下記ルール設定でトーナメントを開始します。<br>よろしいですか？<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507><br>※途中でルールを変更することはできません。</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br><switch $n1><case>・<string $s2><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><br>・<string $s4><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><br>・<string $s4><br>・<string $s5></switch>
#. de: Für das Turnier gelten folgende Regeln:<br><br><switch $n1><case>・<string $s2><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><br>・<string $s4><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><br>・<string $s4><br>・<string $s5></switch><br><br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Die Regeln können im laufenden Turnier nicht geändert werden.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>Möchtest du mit diesen Einstellungen fortfahren?
#. fr: Les règles suivantes seront en vigueur pendant le tournoi<nbsp>:<br><br><switch $n1><case>- <string $s2><case>- <string $s2><br>- <string $s3><case>- <string $s2><br>- <string $s3><br>- <string $s4><case>- <string $s2><br>- <string $s3><br>- <string $s4><br>- <string $s5></switch><br><br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Les règles ne peuvent être modifiées une fois le tournoi commencé.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>Confirmer<nbsp>?
#. macro: <br> — a line break (may be added or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>・<string $s2><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><br>・<string $s4><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><br>… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <string $s2> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $s3> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 3 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $s4> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 4 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <string $s5> — a text value passed to the string; value = text parameter 5 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Addon:9855:0:0"
msgid "The following rules have been set for this tournament:<br><br><switch $n1><case>・<string $s2><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><br>・<string $s4><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><br>・<string $s4><br>・<string $s5></switch><br><br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Rules cannot be changed once the competition has begun.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>Proceed?"
msgstr "Для турнира выбраны следующие правила:<br><br><switch $n1><case>・<string $s2><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><br>・<string $s4><case>・<string $s2><br>・<string $s3><br>・<string $s4><br>・<string $s5></switch><br><br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>После начала турнира правила изменить нельзя.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>Продолжить?"

#. ja: 全員の準備が完了しました。<br>まもなく対戦を開始します。
#. de: Alle Spieler sind bereit.<br>Das Spiel wird gleich beginnen.
#. fr: Tous les par<shy>ti<shy>ci<shy>pants sont prêts.<br>Les duels sont sur le point de commencer.
